// tests/procslots.py: the processes that the test scripts start side by side
// are bounded by GOPP_TEST_SLOTS, for the threads of one script and across
// scripts (three processes of 8 threads here, 3 slots); without the setting
// (a script run by hand) there is no bound.
// RUN: rm -rf %t.slots
// RUN: env GOPP_TEST_SLOTS=3 GOPP_TEST_SLOTS_DIR=%t.slots %python %S/Inputs/proc-slots-check.py 3 8 4 | FileCheck --check-prefix=BOUND %s
// RUN: env -u GOPP_TEST_SLOTS -u GOPP_TEST_SLOTS_DIR %python %S/Inputs/proc-slots-check.py 1 8 1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=FREE %s

// BOUND: spans: 96
// BOUND-NEXT: most at once: 3
// FREE: spans: 8
// FREE-NEXT: most at once: {{[2-8]}}
